    "confidence": 0.6013698577880859,
    "answer": "In a one-based heap array (where elements start at index $1$), the parent and children indices for a node at index $i$ are calculated as follows:\n\n* **Parent index:** $\\text{parent}(i) = i / 2$ [2]\n* **Left child index:** $\\text{left}(i) = 2i$ [2]\n* **Right child index:** $\\text{right}(i) = 2i + 1$ [2]",
